      "group": "Main",
      "note": "4-position rotary: TS9 (silicon pair, 47 nF), + (two in series each way, 0.22 uF), Hot (red LEDs + resistor, 1 uF), Turbo (no diodes, 22 uF). Raw 0/1/2/3 select Turbo/Hot/+/TS9, the rotary's order left to right (service manual p.4 block diagram lists TURBO, HOT, +, TS9DX; the unit face and RealtimeAudioServer paramLabels use the same order); default TS9. Each position switches in exactly one leg cap through its own switch (2026-11-12: the four caps and their switches all sat across leg-vr in parallel, so every mode sounded the same). The catalogue range was extended to 0..3 on 2026-11-09 so every mode is reachable from presets"
